-adjust\" content=\"\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#059669\"/><title>Growman - Plant Store</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Your favorite plant store - shop plants online\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"/><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"Growman\"/><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\" content=\"default\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.f8d45e3b.ico\" sizes=\"48x48\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icons/icon-192x192.png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"geist_9e050971-module__05dp7a__className bg-linear-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-6 p-6 bg-amber-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl shadow-lg\"><div class=\"text-center mb-8\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-green-800 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-8 w-8 mr-2\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M7 11.5V14m0-2.5v-6a1.5 1.5 0 113 0m-3 6a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0v2a7.5 7.5 0 0015 0v-5a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m-6-3V11m0-5.5v-1a1.5 1.5 0 013 0v1m0 0V11m0-5.5a1.5 1.5 0 013 0v3m0 0V11\"></path></svg>Add New Plant</h1><p class=\"text-green-600 mt-2\">Grow your collection with a new green friend</p></div><form class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z\"></path></svg>Plant Name *</label><input placeholder=\"e.g., Monstera Deliciosa\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 border-green-200\" name=\"name\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>Original Price ($)</label><input type=\"number\" step=\"0.01\" placeholder=\"0.00\" class=\"w-full p-3 border border-green-200 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500\" name=\"mrp\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z\"></path></svg>Tax Information</label><input placeholder=\"e.g., GST 5%\" class=\"w-full p-3 border border-green-200 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500\" name=\"taxInfo\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"></path></svg>Brand</label><select name=\"brandId\" class=\"w-full p-3 border border-green-200 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Select brand</option></select></div></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\"></path></svg>Main Product Image (Optional)</label><input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" class=\"w-full p-3 border border-green-200 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2\">Short Description *</label><textarea name=\"shortDescription\" placeholder=\"Brief description for product listings\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 min-h-[100px] border-green-200\"></textarea></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2\">Full Description</label><textarea name=\"fullDescription\" placeholder=\"Detailed description about the plant\" class=\"w-full p-3 border border-green-200 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 min-h-[120px]\"></textarea></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2\">Bag Sizes *</label><div class=\"border border-green-200 rounded-lg p-4 mb-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\"><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2\">Dimension *</label><input placeholder=\"e.g., S, M, L or 1kg, 2kg\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 border-green-200\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2\">Label *</label><input placeholder=\"e.g., Small, Medium, Large\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 border-green-200\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2\">Price ($) *</label><input type=\"number\" step=\"0.01\" placeholder=\"0.00\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 border-green-200\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2\">Stock *</label><input type=\"number\" placeholder=\"0\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 border-green-200\" value=\"0\"/></div></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2\">Images for this size (Optional)<span class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 ml-2\">Upload image files</span></label><div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-2\"><input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" class=\"flex-1 p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 border-green-200\"/><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-red-100 text-red-700 rounded-lg hover:bg-red-200 disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\">Remove</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"mt-2 px-4 py-2 bg-green-100 text-green-700 rounded-lg hover:bg-green-200\">+ Add Another Image</button></div><div class=\"mt-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-red-100 text-red-700 rounded-lg hover:bg-red-200 disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\">Remove Size</button></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"mt-4 px-4 py-2 bg-green-100 text-green-700 rounded-lg hover:bg-green-200\">+ Add Another Size</button></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z\"></path></svg>Category *</label><select name=\"categoryId\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 border-green-200\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Select existing category</option></select><div class=\"mt-2\"><input placeholder=\"Create new category\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 border-green-200\" name=\"newCategory\" value=\"\"/></div></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10\"></path></svg>Subcategory</label><select name=\"subcategoryId\" disabled=\"\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 bg-gray-100 border-green-200\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Select existing subcategory</option></select><div class=\"mt-2\"><input placeholder=\"Create new subcategory\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-300 focus:border-green-500 bg-gray-100 border-green-200\" name=\"newSubcategory\" value=\"\"/></div></div></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2\">Specifications</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-2 mb-2\"><input placeholder=\"Key (e.g., Height)\" class=\"md:col-span-2 p-3 border border-green-200 rounded-lg\" value=\"\"/><input placeholder=\"Value (e.g., 30cm)\" class=\"md:col-span-2 p-3 border border-green-200 rounded-lg\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-red-100 text-red-700 rounded-lg hover:bg-red-200 disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\">Remove</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"mt-2 px-4 py-2 bg-green-100 text-green-700 rounded-lg hover:bg-green-200\">+ Add Specification</button></div><div><label class=\"block text-green-700 font-medium mb-2 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 mr-1\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M7 7h.01M7 3h5c.512 0 1.024.195 1.414.586l7 7a2 2 0 010 2.828l-7 7a2 2 0 01-2.828 0l-7-7A1.994 1.994 0 013 12V7a4 4 0 014-4z\"></path></svg>Plant Tags</label><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"></div></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-lg font-medium text-white transition-all flex items-center justify-center bg-green-700 hover:bg-green-800 hover:shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 mr-2\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 9v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H9m12 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>Add to Collection</button></form></div><!--$--><!--/$--><button class=\"fixed bottom-4 right-4 sm:bottom-6 sm:right-6 z-50 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded-full p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center group\" aria-label=\"Open chat\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle h-5 w-5 sm:h-6 sm:w-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719\"></path></svg></button><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fa504000ca48409e.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>